     - arena_issue_disjoint_of_authority (now issue_disjoint_redundant);
     - arena_reset_rejects_live_issued and arena_reset_rejects_live_storage_access (now arena_reset_rejects_live_access);
     - arena_reset_rejects_live_dependents_underInv (now arena_reset_rejects_live_dependents, with no K hypothesis);
