     - helper lemmas: filterMap_congr', effOf_some_of_not_mem, effective_addAuth_old, SameSkel.preserves, SameSkel.refl, SameSkel.inv3, enter_root_parent, chain_reattach, exitG_fields, org_addAuth_lt.
